+    // customPaymentDate instead of endDate). overnightDayCounter/
+    // iborDayCounter let each leg use an accrual day counter different
+    // from its index's native one. overnightFlatRatePayment/
+    // iborFlatRatePayment switch a leg's cash flow to amount = rate() *
